OL,3,GNEWSAHospital therapy dog Rolo makes
OL,4,Ahis final rounds
OL,5,
OL,6,FA therapy dog that has charmed hospital
OL,7,Fpatients for more than 12 years has
OL,8,Fmade his final rounds for a goodbye pat
OL,9,Fbefore his retirement.
OL,11,FRolo was close to death when he was
OL,12,Frescued from a puppy farm in South
OL,13,FOckenden in Essex by the RSPCA, along
OL,14,Fwith dozens of other dogs, in 2013.
OL,16,FAfter he was nursed back to health, he
OL,17,Flived with Claire Dean in
OL,18,FSouthend-on-Sea, who decided to train
OL,19,Fhim as a Pets As Therapy (PAT) dog,
OL,20,Fbringing joy to hospital wards, care
OL,21,Fhomes and schools.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
